From 1de7f8a789b20ed28e21f3e942de0c3aa7ede4d9 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: =?UTF-8?q?Miroslav=20Mr=C3=A1z?= <mraz.miro@seznam.cz>
Date: Sun, 26 Jul 2026 01:06:53 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 9/9] media: venus: hfi_platform: honor codec blacklist on
 platform codecs path
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

On HFI version 4 and 6 platforms hfi_platform_get_codecs() rebuilds
enc_codecs/dec_codecs from the static platform capability tables,
overwriting the firmware-parsed values that parse_codecs() already
applied the per-resource codec blacklist to. As a result
dec_codec_blacklist/enc_codec_blacklist only ever had an effect on
HFI version 1 platforms.

Apply the blacklist on the platform path as well.

Signed-off-by: Miroslav Mráz <mraz.miro@seznam.cz>
---
 drivers/media/platform/qcom/venus/hfi_platform.c | 3 +++
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+)

diff --git a/drivers/media/platform/qcom/venus/hfi_platform.c b/drivers/media/platform/qcom/venus/hfi_platform.c
index cde7f93045ac..816991100b88 100644
--- a/drivers/media/platform/qcom/venus/hfi_platform.c
+++ b/drivers/media/platform/qcom/venus/hfi_platform.c
@@ -92,6 +92,9 @@ hfi_platform_get_codecs(struct venus_core *core, u32 *enc_codecs,
 		*dec_codecs &= ~HFI_VIDEO_CODEC_VP8;
 	}
 
+	*dec_codecs &= ~core->res->dec_codec_blacklist;
+	*enc_codecs &= ~core->res->enc_codec_blacklist;
+
 	return 0;
 }
 
